==Indonesian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|id|[ˈtɪm]}}
* {{hyphenation|id|tim}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|id|nl|team}}, from {{der|id|en|team}}, from {{der|id|enm|teme}}, from {{der|id|ang|tēam||child-bearing, offspring, [[brood]], set of draught animals}}, from {{der|id|gem-pro|*taumaz||that which draws or pulls}}, from {{der|id|gem-pro|*taugijaną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*tugōną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*teuhōną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*teuhaną||to lead, bring, pull, draw}}, from {{der|id|ine-pro|*dewk-||to pull, lead}}.

====Noun====
{{id-noun|head=}}
# [[team]], any group of people involved in the same activity, especially sports or work.
#: {{syn|id|kelompok|regu}}

===Etymology 2===
* From {{bor|id|en|steam}}, from {{der|id|enm|steem}}, {{m|enm|stem}}, from {{der|id|ang|stēam||steam, hot exhalation, hot breath; that which emits vapour; blood}}, from {{der|id|gem-pro|*staumaz||steam, vapour, breath}}, from {{der|id|ine-pro|*dʰew-||to whirl, waft, stink, shake; steam, haze, smoke}}.
* From {{bor|id|nan-hok|-}} {{zh-l|𤆤|tr=tīm}} or {{zh-l|燖|tr=tīm}} or {{zh-l|𤌯|tr=tīm}}.

====Verb====
{{id-verb|head=}}

# to [[steam]] {{gloss|cook with steam}}
#: {{syn|id|mengetim}}

